Package: panelio
Type: Package
Title: Microbiome Balanced Longitudinal Panel I/O
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("panelio", "authors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "panelio@example.com")
Description: Archive, read, write and convert balanced longitudinal microbiome
    abundance panels. A dataset is stored as a gzipped tar archive holding one
    wide table per time layer plus a machine parsable manifest that carries the
    observation and time metadata. The package provides a lossless read/write
    round trip and a bidirectional contract between the long table
    representation and the three dimensional array representation.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: utils, stats
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), pkgload, roxygen2
NeedsCompilation: yes
SystemRequirements: GNU Fortran (gfortran) compiler
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Language: zh-CN
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
